               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_2f0f019b">8 folios</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_c9e3748d">c.33x20</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_b89607aa">In 2<rend xml:id="idm39" rend="sup">o</rend>; upright format; consisting of 4 nested bifolios (sewn); music (fols. 1r–8r; unnumbered) blank page (fol. 8v); in all 16 pages. Hand-ruled paper, 20 staves on fols. 1r–3v, 19 on fol. 4r, 15 on fol. 4v, 14 on fols. 5r–6v,  20 on fol. 7r, and 14 on fols. 7v–8r (5 mm; single rastrum used) in black ink and music also in black ink. A clean copy with only few changes and corrections in ink. Number of bars noted at the end of movements 1 and 3. Score placed in a dark-bluish folder with a title, written in barrow pen by a twentieth-century hand, pasted on front cover; shelf mark 'III,15' added in pencil. The folder apparently also contained part material that since has been lost as question mark in pencil added after 'Stimme'.</physMedium>
